caveman-offline
===============

This is a derivative work of caveman by Julius Brussee:

    https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman

Upstream is MIT-licensed, with a scope note placing certain Engine-linked
directories under Business Source License 1.1 instead: engine/, proxy/,
cacheengine/, rewriter/, browse/, mcp/, shrink/, the cavemem Go core, and
shared/platform/.

**None of those BSL-licensed directories are present in this repository.**
Everything redistributed here comes from upstream's MIT-licensed portion —
specifically `skills/` and `src/hooks/`. The upstream scope note has therefore
been dropped from LICENSE rather than carried forward, because it referenced a
LICENSING.md and directories that do not exist in this tree and would have been
misleading to readers.

