What was removed, and why
-------------------------

The full rationale is in README.md. Summarised: upstream has grown a hosted
commercial product (a proxy gateway, a telemetry CLI, downloadable binaries)
around what began as a prose-compression skill. This repository redistributes
only the compression part.

No criticism of upstream is intended or implied. The removed components are
legitimate features of a different product; they are simply not what this build
is for.
